#
# This folder contains all the .vhd/.vhf code for the 
# firmware Ethernet interface. 
#
# TOP_LEVEL_template.vhf is an example top level VHDL file.
#
# The constraints were made for Vivado. The coregen components 
# work in Vivado and ISE.
#
#
# The gec directory could be a standalone Ethernet solution
# and is vendor independent. The vendor dependent portion is the
# data_manager because of 4 FIFOs (in the future, perhaps these
# could be inferred,.. otherwise the FIFOs need to be substitued 
# with generated blocks for the particular FPGA/vendor).
#
#
# EXAMPLES are in the otsdaq proof-of-concepts:
#      git clone http://cdcvs.fnal.gov/projects/otsdaqpoc/firmware
#
#   - Example Vivado project v2013.4
#     	      example_vivado_ethernet.zip
#
#   - Example ISE project v14.7
#     	      example_ise_ethernet.zip
#
#

